  brunoDialogue:
  - My lord it is soo cold out there, Im soo happy i am now able to get a pint of lager after this terrible day...
  - What are you looking at. If you want to be helpful why dont you pour me a pint would ya.
  - '6 POUNDSSSSS.... WHO ARE YOU TRYING TO SCAM. (sigh) I guess after today i dont think its soo bad. '
